uggests a sense of transformation, sacrifice, or divine power being released.\n\n**The Ground and Composition:**\nAt the very bottom of the image, a few lit candles are visible, their warm, flickering flames providing a grounding element to the scene. This contrast between the celestial, powerful figure above and the humble, earthly candles below enhances the sense of awe and wonder. The composition is dynamic, with the figure angled diagonally across the frame, creating a sense of motion and ascent.\n\nOverall, the image evokes themes of transcendence, divine power, inner strength, and the soul's journey. It feels like a moment of profound spiritual awakening or ascension. The lighting is masterfully used to draw attention to the glowing heart and the illuminated wings, making the figure appear both divine and human."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 23, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [17], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [2160, 3840, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [270, 120], "pos": [1402.8116455078125, 1829.679443359375], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.40", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [20], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", 